Answer: Regional coordination centres replaced the regional security coordinators established under the system operation guideline adopted on the basis of Article 18(5) of Regulation (EC) No 714/2009. This follows regulatory authorities' approval of the proposal in paragraph 1, and the centres had to enter into operation by 1 July 2022.

