Question: How soon after transfer must congestion income be distributed under the sharing methodology?

Answer: Under Article 73(3) of Regulation (EU) 2015/1222, TSOs must distribute congestion incomes in line with the sharing methodology as soon as reasonably practicable and no later than one week after the congestion incomes have been transferred in accordance with Article 68(8).

